22. Find Daily Revenue Growth %

Formula:
(Current Day Revenue - Previous Day Revenue)
/ Previous Day Revenue * 100

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.window import Window
from pyspark.sql.functions import lag

w = Window.orderBy("sales_date")

df = df.withColumn(
    "prev_revenue",
    lag("revenue").over(w)
)

df = df.withColumn(
    "growth_pct",
    ((df.revenue-df.prev_revenue)
      /df.prev_revenue)*100
)

SQL:

SELECT *,
(
(revenue -
LAG(revenue) OVER(ORDER BY sales_date))
/
LAG(revenue) OVER(ORDER BY sales_date)
)*100 growth_pct
FROM sales;
